 I'd love to invite you to playtest the game and wishlist it! Having a crush on your bestie is hard enough without serial killers in the way! Lily's vacay plan to romance her crush Sally goes wrong when killers keep cropping up and ruining the mood. And that means war. \"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-08T16:47:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366183094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047640-1816849002022392","game_id":"steam-4047640","kind":"announcement","title":"RPG Horror \"Even20\" Now Officially Released!","summary":"Set in Malaysia, the horror RPG Even20: The Interference of Parallels is finally available! Enjoy a limited 15% launch discount for the first 7 days — don’t miss out! https://store.steampowered.com/app/3914200/Even20/ Game Introduction Even20 is a pixel-art horror puzzle RPG emphasizing story, exploration, and real-time combat. Players will experience the game through the perspectives of two protagonists, entering a mysterious world full of monsters and unknown dangers, seeking hope for reunion ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-25T05:12:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002022392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4047640-1816849002012659","game_id":"steam-4047640","kind":"announcement","title":"溫情劇情向遊戲《歸宿之國1》於11/21正式發行！","summary":"關注RMAsia鑑賞家 https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/41570851/c378561246253166a081a7a88d391896e6e00f2e.png 🌟溫情劇情向遊戲《歸宿之國1》於11/21今日正式發行了！ https://store.steampowered.com/app/3345780 遊戲介紹： 《歸宿之國1》是一款以劇情為主的遊戲，描述主角畢帕拉來到地底國度後的生活故事。 「曾經……我擁有一個完整的家，過著平凡而幸福的生活。 然而，某一天，我失去了所有。」一場突如其來的事故，奪去畢帕拉的雙親與家園。 唯有父親留給他的護身符——一顆來